# Repo-local link-check exceptions. Each entry is an exact URL verified alive
# and failing only because the publisher refuses automated clients. Shared
# excludes live in lychee.toml (synced from melodic-software/standards).

# Science and PNAS answer 403 to lychee, curl and a browser User-Agent alike
# (Cloudflare). Both DOIs resolve through the doi.org handle API and Crossref
# indexes both works (verified 2026-10-11); a DOI is the stable citation form.
^https://doi\.org/10\.1126/sciadv\.adt3813$
^https://doi\.org/10\.1073/pnas\.2422455122$

# cdc.gov answers 403 "Access Denied" (Akamai) to lychee, curl and a browser
# User-Agent from this workstation, while a WebFetch from another network
# returned both pages with their content (verified 2026-10-11).
^https://www\.cdc\.gov/ccindex/tool/index\.html$
^https://www\.cdc\.gov/nceh/clearwriting/mod2/index\.html$
